# .NET
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo

# Godot 4
.godot/
.mono/
data_export/
export.cfg
# export_presets.cfg is normally ignored because it can hold signing
# credentials. This project's preset holds none -- it is a plain Linux export
# with no keystore -- and committing it is what makes `tools/export.sh`
# reproducible for anyone else. Re-add the ignore the day a signed preset
# appears, and move the secret out of it rather than out of git.
!export_presets.cfg
*.translation

